claim.claim-text:
• receiving (607) a request from the network node to report a global cell identifier, CGI, of a neighbour cell of the serving cell;
• starting (609) a timer responsive to receiving the request to report the CGI;
• receiving (611) system information from the neighbour cell;
• determining (613) from the system information if the neighbour cell does or does not broadcast a system information block 1; SIB1, comprising the CGI of the neighbour cell;
• transmitting (615, 619, 623) a CGI report to the network node;
• if it is determined from the system information that the neighbour cell does not broadcast SIB1 comprising the CGI of the neighbour cell, transmitting (615) the CGI report before expiration (621) of the timer;
wherein
• the CGI report includes an indication that the SIB1 is absent and further comprises an information indicative of whether the UE was able or not able to detect the CGI of the neighbor cell.

• transmitting (707) a request to the UE to report a global cell identifier, CGI, of a neighbour cell of the serving cell;
• receiving (709) a CGI report from the UE, wherein the CGI Report comprises an indication if a System Information Block, SIB 1, is present or absent;
• wherein the CGI report comprises an information indicative of whether the UE was able or not able to detect the CGI of the neighbor cell; and
• taking an action in dependency of the flag and the cell identifier information field.
